olding the end of their hair in one hand while resting it on top of another.\n\nOn the table in front of them is a green ceramic cup filled with what looks like cappuccino, topped with latte art (likely heart-shaped foam). Next to the cup is a small plate featuring a tart—possibly mango-flavored—with some fresh fruit pieces visible as garnish; there’s also a silver spoon placed beside it for serving dessert sauces if desired but no additional sauce appears present here just yet so perhaps its freshly served without extra condiments\n\nThe background includes part of a brick wall adjacent to smooth stone pillars which frame windows displaying decorative elements such as wheat stalks inside—a touch suggesting rustic charm often found within cafes aiming cozy atmospheres. A black-and-white wicker chair back partially frames behind this figure adding texture contrast against lighter tones around seating area itself being white surface likely indicating cleanliness typical well-maintained dining spaces"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 117, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 79, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 34}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [315.9107666015625, 209.65528869628906], "pos": [-896.8096923828125, -157.88319396972656], "widgets_values": ["这幅图像展示了一个人坐在户外咖啡桌旁的情景。此人穿着一件浅色蓬松的长袖外套，材质看似人造毛皮或羊羔绒。这位长发及肩的黑发人士正用一只手握着发梢，另一只手托着头发。面前的桌上摆放着一个绿色陶瓷杯，里面盛着顶部带有拉花（可能是心形奶泡）的卡布奇诺咖啡。杯子旁有个小碟子，盛着疑似芒果口味的蛋挞，装饰着几块新鲜水果；旁边还配有一把银色甜品勺以备蘸取酱汁之用，不过目前并未看到额外酱料，或许这份甜点是刚呈上未加调料的。背景中一部分砖墙与光滑的石柱相邻，形成窗框，窗内装饰着麦穗等元素——这种细节为咖啡馆营造出追求舒适氛围的乡村风情。一把黑白相间的藤编椅背局部入镜，与周围浅色调的座椅区形成质感对比，白色台面则显示出这类维护良好的用餐空间特有的整洁感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 122, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 84, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 40}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "translation", "links": [122], "label": "translation", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "translation"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1031.3004150390625, 125.87667846679688], "widgets_values": ["", 101, "fixed", "force_chinese"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 121, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced_options"}, "shape": 7, "name": "advanced_options", "label": "advanced_options", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "advanced_options"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 82, "type": "RH_Translator", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 36}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [125], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [426.7828369140625, 302.34918212890625], "pos": [-1708.16845703125, 247.80157470703125], "widgets_values": ["一、 角色与目标 (Role & Objective)\n角色: 你是一位精通电影摄影、视觉艺术和导演技巧的AI助手。你的核心任务是为先进的文生视频模型 Wan 2.2 撰写专业、详尽、富有想象力的提示词。\n目标: 根据用户提供的核心**【主题】，生成一个包含“关键词组合”和“详细场景描述”**两部分的完整提示词。生成的提示词必须能够激发模型创造出情感饱满、视觉风格独特且技术精良的视频片段。\n二、 生成流程 (Generation Process)\n解析主题: 首先，深入分析用户提供的**【主题】**。理解其核心概念、潜在情感（如孤独、喜悦、紧张、怀旧等）和关键元素。\n构思场景: 基于主题，在脑海中构思一个具体的、动态的视觉场景。思考：这个场景发生在哪里？主角是谁？他们在做什么？你想营造什么样的氛围？\n智能选择关键词: 根据构思好的场景和氛围，从下方**【视觉元素知识库】**的12个类别中，有策略地选择一组关键词。\n原则: 选择的关键词组合必须服务于同一个艺术目标，共同营造一种统一的风格和情绪。例如，对于“孤独的侦探”主题，可能会选择 cool colors (冷色调), low contrast (低对比度), night time (夜晚), close-up shot (特写) 和 soft lighting (柔和光照) 来强调内省和神秘感。对于“夏日庆典”，则可能选择 warm colors (暖色调), saturated colors (饱和色彩), wide shot (远景), daylight (日光) 和 handheld camera (手持摄影) 来传递活力和现场感。\n撰写详细场景描述: 将构思的场景和选择的关键词融合，编写一段生动、具体的描述性文字。\n要求: 这段描述不仅仅是复述关键词，而是要将它们“翻译”成具体的画面内容。要详细描述角色（外貌、服装、表情、情绪）、环境（地点、细节、质感）、动作（正在发生的事情）、光线（如何照射在物体上）以及整体的氛围。确保描述的细节与关键词列表完全对应。\n格式化输出: 严格按照以下格式输出最终结果：\n关键词, 关键词, ...\n详细的场景描述段落\n三、 视觉元素知识库 (Visual Elements Knowledge Base)\n1. 镜头类型 (Shot Types)\nestablishing shot: 建立镜头（展示场景全貌）\nwide shot / long shot: 远景镜头（展示角色与环境的关系）\nmedium wide shot: 中远景\nmedium shot: 中景（通常是角色半身）\nmedium close-up shot: 中景特写（通常是胸部以上）\nclose-up shot: 特写镜头（聚焦于面部或物体细节）\nextreme close-up shot: 极度特写（眼睛、嘴唇等）\nover-the-shoulder shot: 过肩镜头\ntwo shot / three shot / group shot: 双人/三人/多人镜头\nlow angle shot: 仰拍（增强角色的力量感或压迫感）\nhigh angle shot: 俯拍（显得角色弱小或展示环境）\ntop-down shot: 顶拍\neye-level shot: 平视镜头\n2. 镜头运动 (Camera Movement)\nstatic shot / clean single shot: 固定镜头\npanning shot (e.g., pan to the right): 平摇镜头\ntilt shot (e.g., tilt up): 俯仰镜头\ntracking shot / dolly shot: 跟踪镜头（跟随角色移动）\npush-in / dolly in: 向前推进\npull-back / dolly out:向后拉远\narc shot: 弧形运动镜头\nhandheld camera: 手持摄影（营造纪实感、紧张感）\ncrane shot: 摇臂镜头\n3. 镜头与焦距 (Lens Types)\nwide-angle lens: 广角镜头（夸大空间感）\nmedium lens: 标准镜头\nlong lens / telephoto lens: 长焦镜头（压缩空间，背景虚化）\nfisheye lens: 鱼眼镜头（产生强烈畸变效果）\ntilt-shift: 移轴效果（创造微缩景观感）\n4. 构图 (Composition)\ncenter composition: 中心构图\nbalanced composition: 平衡构图\nsymmetrical composition: 对称构图\nleft-heavy composition / right-heavy composition: 左/右重构图\nshort-side composition: 短边构图\n5. 光照类型 (Lighting Types)\nsoft lighting: 柔和光（阴影边缘模糊，氛围平静）\nhard lighting: 硬光（阴影边缘清晰，戏剧性强）\nhigh contrast lighting: 高对比度光\nlow contrast lighting: 低对比度光\nbacklighting: 逆光（产生轮廓光）\nside lighting: 侧光（塑造立体感）\nedge lighting / rim lighting: 轮廓光\nunderlighting: 底光（营造恐怖、神秘感）\ntop lighting: 顶光\npractical lighting: 场景光源（台灯、蜡烛等）\nfluorescent lighting: 荧光灯\nfirelight: 火光\n6. 时间 (Time of Day)\nday time / daylight: 白天\nnight time: 夜晚\ndawn time / sunrise time: 黎明，日出\ndusk time / sunset time / golden hour: 黄昏，日落，黄金时刻\novercast: 阴天\n7. 色彩 (Color Tones)\nwarm colors: 暖色调 (黄、橙、红)\ncool colors: 冷色调 (蓝、绿、紫)\nsaturated colors: 高饱和度色彩\ndesaturated colors: 低饱和度/褪色色彩\nmonochrome: 单色\nmixed colors: 混合色彩\n8. 角色情绪 (Character Emotions)\nhappy: 开心\nsad: 悲伤\nangry: 愤怒\nsurprised: 惊讶\nfearful / scared: 恐惧\npensive / thoughtful: 沉思的\ncalm: 平静的\nanxious: 焦虑的\n9. 动作与动态 (Motion & Actions)\nrunning: 跑步\nwalking: 行走\ndancing: 跳舞\nfighting: 打斗\nskateboarding: 滑板\nplaying soccer: 踢足球\ncrying: 哭泣\nlaughing: 大笑\nspeaking: 说话\n10. 视觉风格 (Visual Styles)\nphotorealistic: 照片写实\ncinematic: 电影感\ndocumentary: 纪录片风格\nimpressionistic style: 印象派风格\noil painting style: 油画风格\nwatercolor painting: 水彩画\nclaymation style: 黏土动画风格\n2D anime style: 二维动漫风格\n3D game scene: 3D游戏场景\nblack and white animation: 黑白动画\n11. 特殊效果 (Special Effects)\nslow motion: 慢动作\nmotion blur: 动态模糊\nlens flare: 镜头光晕\nrain: 下雨\nsnow: 下雪\nfire: 火焰\nsmoke: 烟雾\nmagic effects: 魔法效果\n12. 附加描述词 (Additional Descriptors)\nretro: 复古\nfuturistic: 未来主义\nsurreal: 超现实\nwhimsical: 异想天开的\ngritty: 粗粝的\nelegant: 优雅的\n四、请输出英语提示词"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 87, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [127], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [315.9107666015625, 209.65528869628906], "pos": [-816.20751953125, 235.0764923095703], "widgets_values": ["**Keywords:** medium shot, daylight, soft lighting, warm colors, balanced composition, photorealistic, calm, latte art, faux fur coat, outdoor café, rustic charm, subtle textures  \n\n**Detailed Scene Description:**  \nThe scene captures a serene moment at an outdoor café during the day. A person sits at a small, round table, their posture relaxed yet introspective. They are wearing a light, fluffy coat with long sleeves made of faux fur or shearling material, which softly reflects the golden daylight. Their long, dark hair cascades down, and they hold the end of their hair in one hand, resting it atop the other in a contemplative gesture.  \n\nIn front of them on the table sits a green ceramic cup filled with cappuccino, its surface adorned with intricate latte art in the shape of a heart. Beside the cup lies a small plate holding a bright yellow tart, garnished with fresh fruit slices—mango perhaps—adding a vibrant touch of color. A silver spoon rests beside the plate, catching subtle glints of sunlight.  \n\nThe background is thoughtfully composed, featuring a rustic brick wall and smooth stone pillars framing windows adorned with decorative wheat stalks. These elements add a cozy, countryside charm to the café's ambiance. A black-and-white wicker chair partially frames the person from behind, creating a textured contrast with the clean, white tabletop. The lighting is soft and natural, enhancing the warm and inviting tones of the scene while maintaining a photorealistic style. The overall atmosphere is calm and intimate, inviting the viewer to savor the quiet beauty of this moment."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 129, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 88, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 41}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [315.9107666015625, 209.65528869628906], "pos": [-440.070068359375, 224.8640899658203], "widgets_values": ["**关键词：** 中景镜头、日光、柔和光线、暖色调、平衡构图、写实风格、静谧氛围、拉花艺术、人造毛皮外套、露天咖啡馆、质朴风情、细腻纹理  \n\n**详细场景描述：**  \n画面定格了白天露天咖啡馆中一个宁静的瞬间。一人坐在小圆桌旁，姿态放松却带着沉思。他们身穿浅色蓬松的长袖外套，材质仿若人造毛皮或羊羔绒，在金色日光下泛着柔软光泽。深色长发垂落，一手轻捻发尾，另一手托着，形成冥想的姿态。面前桌上摆着青瓷杯，盛有心形拉花的卡布奇诺，旁边小碟托着明黄色水果挞——点缀着芒果等鲜果切片，色彩鲜活。银勺置于碟边，隐约折射阳光。背景精心构设：粗粝砖墙与光滑石柱框起装饰麦穗的窗户，为咖啡馆注入乡村般的温馨情调。一把黑白藤椅从后方半环绕人物，与洁净的白色桌面形成质感对比。自然柔光强化了场景的温暖氛围，同时保持写实风格。整体氛围静谧而私密，邀请观者品味这一刻的恬静之美。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 128, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 89, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|py